{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feather Land</strong> is an idle game designed for focus and mental tranquility, blending a companion-style study/work experience into your daily life. By purchasing and nurturing various birds and building your own natural ecosystem, you can enjoy relaxing interactions and the company of nature without interrupting your work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Close bird companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different species of birds and establish emotional connections with them. Watch your forest evolves from a quiet space to a vibrant ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/0e04497eb9bc7ba4bb8ba13f16839911.avif?t=1760362303\" width=800 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Focus tools to enhance work efficiency</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize focus tools to help manage your time and tasks. The built-in Pomodoro timer and clock allow you to efficiently allocate work time and maintain concentration. The To-do List and notebook offer spaces to jot down tasks, helping you stay organized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/7547c9df7e45403d923472e68bc0e484.avif?t=1760362303\" width=800 height=446 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing background music and natural sound effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soothing background music and natural environmental sounds, like birdsong and wind, create a calm atmosphere that perfectly fits your work or study space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/b9e33f610cf46055581dfba26b8363ad.avif?t=1760362303\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your own ecosystem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this forest, you can freely customize birds and habitats based on your preferences. From simple bird eggs to rare species, from dawn to dusk, every choice in the game helps you create a natural space that matches your mindset. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/58c45b24f40e5372893981eda46b07e2.avif?t=1760362303\" width=800 height=443 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661430?t=1760362303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661430?t=1760362303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/fafa3b27ef58e3c7a600f6138d647f04f4a66c01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760362303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/fafa3b27ef58e3c7a600f6138d647f04f4a66c01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760362303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feather Land</strong> is an idle game designed for focus and mental tranquility, blending a companion-style study/work experience into your daily life. By purchasing and nurturing various birds and building your own natural ecosystem, you can enjoy relaxing interactions and the company of nature without interrupting your work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Close bird companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different species of birds and establish emotional connections with them. Watch your forest evolves from a quiet space to a vibrant ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/0e04497eb9bc7ba4bb8ba13f16839911.avif?t=1760362303\" width=800 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Focus tools to enhance work efficiency</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize focus tools to help manage your time and tasks. The built-in Pomodoro timer and clock allow you to efficiently allocate work time and maintain concentration. The To-do List and notebook offer spaces to jot down tasks, helping you stay organized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/7547c9df7e45403d923472e68bc0e484.avif?t=1760362303\" width=800 height=446 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing background music and natural sound effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soothing background music and natural environmental sounds, like birdsong and wind, create a calm atmosphere that perfectly fits your work or study space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/b9e33f610cf46055581dfba26b8363ad.avif?t=1760362303\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your own ecosystem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this forest, you can freely customize birds and habitats based on your preferences. From simple bird eggs to rare species, from dawn to dusk, every choice in the game helps you create a natural space that matches your mindset. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/58c45b24f40e53728939